  "description": "Lady Sharen Tort Von Atrina, who was once Na-Ra Lee in South Korea, has transmigrated into the story of The Empress’s Extravagant Outing. In this fictional world, she must rewrite her fate and avoid death by helping her cousin, who is also the villainess, Carrel, become a better person. As Sharen begins to make progress in her new life, it seems as if Na-Ra’s soul is calling her back to Korea… \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
